-enroll 0x96 01..04, identify, object info on templates and the delete of a
-user. The driver never sends bootloader patch, peek/poke, provision,
-ownership commands, storage writes or formats, request 0x15, or anything
-else not seen in the traces.
+tudor_cmd_allowed() lets through only: the commands for open and listing
+above, LED, events, frame acquire and finish, enroll 0x96 01..04, identify,
+object info on templates and payloads, object data on payloads, the delete
+of a user and the cleanup of partitions 1 to 3. The driver never sends
